# AI Core: Production Systems Audit & SaaS Engineering Roadmap

> **Audit Status:** Comprehensive Line-by-Line Inspection Complete  
> **Standard:** ISO/IEC 14882:2023 (C++23) | NVIDIA CUDA (sm_89)  
> **Total Action Items:** 25 Tasks Across 5 Priority Tiers

