## Priority 3: Reliability, Persistence & Systems Safeguards

- [ ] **P3.01 — Model Checkpointing & Parameter Serialization**
  - **Classification:** `Persistence` / `Enterprise Reliability`
  - **Defect:** No mechanism exists to save, serialize, or restore neural weights ($W, b$), optimizer momentum, learning rates, or epoch counters.
  - **Action Required:** Build an atomic binary checkpoint engine (`save_checkpoint` / `load_checkpoint`) writing to a temporary file before atomic rename (`.tmp` $\rightarrow$ `.ckpt`).

- [ ] **P3.02 — Dataset Schema Versioning & Header Verification**
  - **Location:** [`parser.hpp:L82-102`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Brain/learning/deepLearning/include/parser.hpp#L82-L102) and [`optimizer.cpp:L16-22`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Brain/learning/deepLearning/util/optimizer.cpp#L16-L22)
  - **Classification:** `Data Integrity` / `Validation`
  - **Defect:** `embedded_data.bin` contains raw floating-point bytes with no header, versioning, dimension attributes, or checksum. Corrupted or mismatched files cause undefined training behavior.
  - **Action Required:** Prepend a validated binary header struct:
    ```cpp
    struct alignas(64) DatasetHeader {
        char magic[4] = {'A', 'I', 'C', 'R'};
        uint32_t version = 1;
        uint32_t embedding_dim = 4;
        uint64_t total_tokens = 0;
        uint32_t crc32_checksum = 0;
        char reserved[40] = {0};
    };
    ```

- [ ] **P3.03 — Replace Silent Returns with Robust Error Handling**
  - **Location:** [`optimizer.cpp:L10`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Brain/learning/deepLearning/util/optimizer.cpp#L10) and [`parser.hpp:L94-96`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Brain/learning/deepLearning/include/parser.hpp#L94-L96)
  - **Classification:** `Error Handling` / `Observability`
  - **Defect:** When file opens fail or buffer locks are active, methods print to `std::cerr` and return `void`. Callers cannot detect whether operations succeeded or were skipped.
  - **Action Required:** Return explicit `std::expected<void, SystemError>` or `bool` status codes.

- [ ] **P3.04 — Modernize Build Portability (Remove Hardcoded Workstation Paths)**
  - **Location:** [`Makefile:L5-10`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/Brain/Makefile#L5-L10)
  - **Classification:** `Toolchain` / `Portability`
  - **Defect:** MSVC path (`14.44.35207`) and CUDA directory (`v13.3`) are hardcoded to a specific Windows workstation, failing builds on any other machine or CI runner.
  - **Action Required:** Read paths dynamically from environment variables (`CUDA_PATH`, `VCToolsInstallDir`) or resolve via `vswhere.exe`.

